Z||000003||jelly2m8||12-19-2001||04:23 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dumba$$:<BR><B>c'mon some one has to know the factory 15" tire size?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>205/60R15's on front.<BR>215/60R15's on back.<P>If your speedometer is wrong, you may have the incorrect drive gear on the VSS.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://users.eastlink.ca/~acook1/pegged%2001.jpg"> ||||reg||1
